{"3866380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You're My Favorite Person", "steam_appid": 3866380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3866410], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU'RE MY FAVORITE PERSON.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YMFP is a <u>short puzzle-based psychological horror game </u>about <strong>you</strong>. After meeting a furry friend that lives in your computer, it takes you through <u>several levels with puzzles</u> for you to solve inside. Upon completing each level, you're <u>granted a Perfect Star</u> and get to go back...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE'S NO ONE LIKE YOU.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a <u>unique gameplay style</u> that builds off of the previous. While their puzzles act as an anchor, <u>anything can happen</u>. These levels are as follows:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hills</strong> - The tutorial space where you can learn about the basic game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office</strong> - Complete a timed scavenger hunt that resets if you fail, always giving you another chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong> - Play multiple arcade games and enjoy a nice break from the pressure of the levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon</strong> - Learn more about your friend and use that knowledge to your advantage in intense puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>???</strong> - There was another, but...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE CAN BE TOGETHER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <u>all isn't as it seems</u> in these digital worlds. What's really going on below the surface of these areas you're placed into? Are any of them real? <i>Are <strong>you</strong>?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOREVER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why wait? <u>Play for free soon.</u></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU'RE MY FAVORITE PERSON.</h2><p class